---

A ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/type-system.td")} where the static judgment "term $t$ has type $T$" implies a corresponding semantic property at runtime - formalized as: if the type system accepts a program, execution cannot produce behaviors the types claim to exclude.

